	"title"		"Extraction Mode PDA Integration"
	"description"		"[h1]Extraction Mode PDA Integration[/h1]
Adds Extraction Mode screens to the ProjectRPGExpanded Survivor PDA.
[h2]Features[/h2]
[list][*]Adds an Extraction tab and lets you choose it as the PDA's startup screen.
[*]Provides dedicated PDA pages for the overview, upgrades, missions, barter and garage, with scrolling and the original two-column garage layout.
[*]Shows item icons for upgrade and mission requirements, skill book volumes, and mission rewards.
[*]Organizes barter offers into trader tabs and provides named target selectors for repair services.
[*]Integrates destination selection, deployment, social, administration and debug screens with the PDA.
[*]Shows destination, team readiness, hideout generator controls and a mission summary on the dashboard.
[*]Shows a contextual boarding button when Extraction Mode allows boarding, using its native action.
[*]Lets you track an unfinished mission and see its objectives and requirements on the dashboard.
[*]Explains that raids have no fixed end time and shows the next horde or wave timing when available.
[*]Adds a Zombies category to ProjectRPGExpanded's server settings with per-stage Custom World Danger controls for zombie behavior, perception, infection and respawn rules.
[*]Uses the PDA's own language setting, with English and Brazilian Portuguese text.
[*]Hides the native Extraction Mode interface while its PDA interface is active, and closes integrated pages with the PDA.
[*]Hides the ProjectRPGExpanded player portrait while the world map is open to prevent map icon rendering issues, and keeps the player card behind Ergonomic UI.
[*]In single-player with the Viewpoint beta, direct UI rendering keeps the open PDA updating with each game frame.[/list]
[h2]Requirements[/h2]
[list][*]Project Zomboid Build 42.21 or newer
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3785397275]Extraction Mode[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3826426915]ProjectRPGExpanded[/url][/list]
This addon is independent of Viewpoint Extraction Support. If the installed PDA does not provide the expected interface methods, Extraction Mode's original screens remain available.

Workshop ID: 3831366933
Mod ID: ExtractionModePDA"
	"changenote" "0.2.1: Improves upgrade and mission item icons, adds trader tabs and named service target selectors, and protects the PDA garage 3D preview."
}
